{"1820620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voxelgram 2", "steam_appid": 1820620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Voxelgram 2 is a 3D nonogram logic game, where you solve puzzles by sculpting voxel models and uncovering dioramas made from them.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820620/extras/1148c2913a05556ae1fa60f18e57b3a5.poster.avif?t=1785486350\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820620/extras/1148c2913a05556ae1fa60f18e57b3a5.webm?t=1785486350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820620/extras/1148c2913a05556ae1fa60f18e57b3a5.mp4?t=1785486350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Voxelgram 2 features 250 new puzzles and a fresh set of rules, now with two colors in play. The puzzles are organized into 20 handcrafted dioramas.<br></li><li>If you own the previous Voxelgram game, you'll also get access to the original puzzles, reworked to fit the new two-color rules. That means an extra 250 puzzles to solve!<br></li><li>For endless replayability, the game features procedurally generated puzzles with different sizes, shapes, and features.<br></li><li>You can also play puzzles created by other players, thanks to support for the Steam Workshop.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820620/extras/8ed02b893e0dcc4c6a75af033e2c3979.avif?t=1785486350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820620/extras_big/8ed02b893e0dcc4c6a75af033e2c3979.avif?t=1785486350 width=800 height=398 /></span>", "about_the_